# Legacy macOS bundle tool definitions.
# These functions (TOOL_BUNDLE, TOOL_WRITE_VAL) are unused — actual bundle
# building is handled by scons/bundle.py, called from SConstruct.
# The original code used deprecated SCons APIs (SharedCheck, ProgScan,
# SCons.Util.is_List, SCons.Node.FS.default_fs) that no longer exist in
# modern SCons, so the dead code has been removed to avoid import errors.
